flowchart TD

A[Lambda Handler]

A --> B[withApiHandler]

B --> C{FHIR Enabled?}

C -->|No| D[Normal API Response]

C -->|Yes| E[transformToFhirResponse]

E --> F[FhirTransformationService]

F --> G[ResourceDiscoveryService]

G --> H[Resource Registry]

H --> I[Generated Resource Config]

I --> G

F --> J[Mapping Resolver]

J --> K[Default Mapping Registry]

J --> L[Client Mapping Registry]

F --> M[Generic Mapper]

M --> N[Terminology Service]

N --> O[FHIR Validator]

O --> P[Bundle Builder]

P --> Q[FHIR Bundle]

Q --> R[Success Response]

R --> S[data + fhir]